        "@value": "Meditation and Creativity in Nature"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tend to ecological grief through expressive arts vehicles such as drawing, writing, mindfulness, and sound-making in a supportive group. Musician and workshop facilitator Anna Bigland-Pritchard will guide you through a supportive, creative afternoon at the Gardens at HCP"
